    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that everything feels so heavy. like no matter how much i \"rest\" or sleep, i wake up and it's just the same weight. it feels like i'm just performing being a person every day and i'm so exhausted from the act. i feel like i've reached the end of my rope and there's just nothing beyond it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
